        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2325] When the configurable mechanism as defined by [V2G20-2320] indicates that the curve as defined by [V2G20-2674] needs to be used, certificates and certificate profiles as defined in Table B.3, Table B.5, Table B.7, Table B.9, Table B.11, Table B.13, Table B.15 and Table B.17 for that particular certificate type shall be used during certificate validation (as defined by [V2G20-1001]).",
